#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:5
#: c069bea8a0474d27b46e4763df76e6e6
msgid "Power Monitor/Module Configuration in Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中的电源监控器/模块配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: b4af8ba25e7b4fc8a8fea4e1010240a5
msgid ""
"Up to 16 battery monitors may be used in ArduPilot, with parameter groups "
"named BATT\\_ through BATT9\\_ for the first 10, and BATTA\\_ thru BATTF\\_ "
"for the last 6 monitors. For this article all parameter name references will"
" be shown for the first monitor, BATT\\_"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中最多可使用 16 个电池监控器，参数组名称从 BATT\\_ 到 BATT9\\_ 用于前 10 个，BATTA\\_ 到 "
"BATTF\\_ 用于后 6 个监控器。本文中所有参数名称均以第一个监控器 BATT\\_ 为例进行说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:9
#: bb6c5320debd4440a68eec215f61a3d0
msgid ""
"A power monitor can be used to measure the battery voltage and current for "
"use in the battery failsafe and a power module can also provide a stable "
"power supply to the autopilot."
msgstr "电源监控器可用于测量电池电压和电流，供电池失控保护使用；电源模块还可以为飞控提供稳定的电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:11
#: 1f528bc074a84112af769fc2210cb933
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is :ref:`compatible with a number of power modules/monitors "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>`."
msgstr "ArduPilot :ref:`兼容多种电源模块/监控器 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:13
#: f44364cc3c0948b8a1d59bec0bf89f6d
msgid ""
"Boards with integrated power monitors have their parameters setup by "
"default."
msgstr "带集成电源监控器的飞控板默认已配置好其参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:16
#: 04ce339bba3048ef9438bc77eed507a3
msgid "Mission Planner Setup"
msgstr "Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:18
#: cb7197b4c9844657af66b24f00e40a5b
msgid ""
"Battery measurement is primarily set up in the *Mission Planner*'s **INITIAL"
" SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| Battery Monitor** screen. Note that "
"currently Mission Planner only supports the first two Battery Monitors in "
"the system (a total of 10 are available in firmware versions 4.0 and later)."
" More would need to be configured directly by directly setting their "
"parameters in the **CONFIG/TUNING\\|Full Parameter List** screen."
msgstr ""
"电池测量主要在 *Mission Planner* 的 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| "
"Battery Monitor** 界面中设置。请注意，目前 Mission Planner 仅支持系统中的前两个电池监控器（固件 4.0 "
"及更高版本共提供 10 个）。更多监控器需要在 **CONFIG/TUNING\\|Full Parameter List** 界面中直接设置其参数。"

