#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:84
#: f8298f869e8c40c48e6b86ce97976978
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` bit 0, if set, will ignore the State Of "
"Charge field in DroneCAN monitors, since some do not populate this field "
"with meaningful data, and the null data takes priority over Ardupilot's own "
"information. For this reason, setting bit 0 can solve an issue where the "
"battery level always reports as 0%. Also various options for MPPT type "
"monitors are provided. Bit 6 allows the resting voltage to be sent in place "
"of battery voltage, which is sometime more useful. Bit 7 allows the Battery "
"Auxilliary info from another DroneCAN monitor with the same "
":ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to be used for this monitor "
"instance. Bit 8 is that the battery is for internal autopilot use only. For "
"Bit 9 if set, the Sum monitor type measures minimum voltage instead of "
"average."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位，如果设置，将忽略 DroneCAN "
"监控器中的荷电状态字段，因为某些监控器不在此字段填充有效数据，而空数据会优先于 ArduPilot 自身的信息。因此，设置第 0 "
"位可以解决电池电量始终显示为 0% 的问题。此外还提供了 MPPT 类型监控器的各种选项。第 6 位允许发送静息电压代替电池电压，有时更有用。第 7 "
"位允许将具有相同 :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 的另一个 DroneCAN "
"监控器的电池辅助信息用于此监控器实例。第 8 位表示电池仅供飞控内部使用。第 9 位如果设置，Sum 监控器类型将测量最低电压而非平均电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:85
#: 952251e3620c467e8194e0b0df349db5
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_SUM_MASK<BATT_SUM_MASK>` is used if the monitor is type \"10\" "
"(Sum Of Selected Monitors) to select which monitors' reported voltages will "
"be averaged, and current values will be summed, and reported for this "
"monitor. Selecting this monitor's own instance number has no effect. If no "
"bits are set, it will average all higher numbered instance's reports."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_SUM_MASK<BATT_SUM_MASK>` "
"在监控器类型为「10」（所选监控器之和）时使用，用于选择哪些监控器的报告电压将被平均、电流值将被求和并为此监控器报告。选择此监控器本身的实例编号无效。如果未设置任何位，将对所有编号更高的实例报告取平均值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:86
#: 3544297b449c494e8f2c865118942341
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_ARM_VOLT<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` is the minimum voltage reported from "
"this monitor that will allow arming to occur."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_ARM_VOLT<BATT_ARM_VOLT>` 是此监控器报告的允许解锁的最低电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:87
#: 7f8ce006ccad427c9c4e6541b04c0eac
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_ARM_MAH<BATT_ARM_MAH>` is the minimum capacity remaining reported"
" from this monitor that will allow arming to occur."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_ARM_MAH<BATT_ARM_MAH>` 是此监控器报告的允许解锁的最低剩余容量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:88
#: 0976f22ddf3246b988aceea2366e1d9c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_MULT<BATT_CURR_MULT>` allows adjusting the current scale for"
" DroneCAN(UAVCAN) monitors which do not have a CAN parameter exposed for "
"adjustment."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_MULT<BATT_CURR_MULT>` 允许调整 DroneCAN（UAVCAN）监控器的电流比例，用于没有 CAN"
" 参数可供调整的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:89
#: 5a2c139a99774e109bfb735a0cb877f0
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` is used to designate which battery "
"an SMBUS or DroneCAN monitor is associated, since multiple instances of "
"these monitors are possible."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 用于指定 SMBUS 或 DroneCAN "
"监控器关联的电池，因为这些监控器可以有多个实例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:90
#: c7a7280af5c0439184d4ae60e4459465
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_MAX_AMPS<BATT_MAX_AMPS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2XX>` applies only to "
"INA2xx sensors. Controls the maximum current which can be reported. This "
"sensor is usually integrated onto the autopilot board and this value preset "
"appropriately in the firmware. Normally, the user would only adjust this if "
"the power monitor OEM suggest that it be set to a certain value."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_MAX_AMPS<BATT_MAX_AMPS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2XX>` 仅适用于 INA2xx "
"传感器，控制可报告的最大电流。该传感器通常集成在飞控板上，固件中已预设适当值。通常情况下，只有在电源监控器原厂建议设置为特定值时，用户才需要调整此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:93
#: 4d4dc4f2dfae45f79e3358b2bf6c4eca
msgid "Failsafe"
msgstr "失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:95
#: bce2e888b72842f8b3bfb11ebde5eb3b
msgid ""
"Failsafes can be implemented for low battery/fuel conditions. For Plane see "
":ref:`plane:apms-failsafe-function`, for Copter see :ref:`copter:failsafe-"
"battery`, or for Rover see :ref:`rover:rover-failsafes`"
msgstr ""
"可以为低电量/低燃油状态实施失控保护。Plane 请参见 :ref:`plane:apms-failsafe-function`，Copter 请参见 "
":ref:`copter:failsafe-battery`，Rover 请参见 :ref:`rover:rover-failsafes`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:100
#: cfc2615ffc7340e9b327da1ca8a9243b
msgid "Analog Monitor Calibration"
msgstr "模拟监控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:102
#: 4c5bd3a2c15d4302a5491a4a891e99c1
msgid ""
"The bottom section of the *Battery Monitor* screen allows you to calibrate "
"the voltage/current measurement in order to verify that the measured voltage"
" of the battery is correct. You can also set the **Sensor** selection list "
"to **Other** and use the calibration process to configure an \"unknown\" "
"power monitor/module."
msgstr ""
"*Battery Monitor* 界面底部允许您校准电压/电流测量，以验证测量的电池电压是否正确。您也可以将 **Sensor** 选择列表设置为 "
"**Other**，并通过校准过程配置「未知」电源监控器/模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:108
#: 310d8badca574c61b967319d72a3d798
msgid "To calibrate the voltage reading:"
msgstr "校准电压读数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:110
#: e9539cf22132473191802a178a38a2a1
msgid ""
"Check the voltage of your LiPo battery with a hand-held volt meter or a "
"`power analyzer <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-130a-watt-meter-and-"
"power-analyzer.html?___store=en_us>`__"
msgstr ""
"用手持万用表或 `功率分析仪 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-130a-watt-meter-and-"
"power-analyzer.html?___store=en_us>`__ 检测您的 LiPo 电池电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:112
#: b1d7ee68f6224c5eb2688d94d113a7d5
msgid ""
"Connect your Pixhawk-series to your computer and plug in the LiPo battery"
msgstr "将 Pixhawk 系列飞控连接到计算机并插入 LiPo 电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:113
#: a1ad4bfdef89460097bcd98759e66580
msgid ""
"Check the voltage through the *Mission Planner*'s **INITIAL SETUP \\| "
"Optional Hardware \\| Battery Monitor** screen or on the Flight Data "
"screen's HUD or *Status* tab."
msgstr ""
"通过 *Mission Planner* 的 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| Battery "
"Monitor** 界面，或飞行数据界面的 HUD 或 *Status* 标签页查看电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:120
#: a3411f9147924eb58820951fe38f0dad
msgid ""
"If you find the voltage is not correct (i.e. if off from the hand-held volt "
"meter's reading by more than perhaps 0.2V) you can calibrate it by doing the"
" following:"
msgstr "如果发现电压不正确（即与手持万用表读数相差超过约 0.2V），可按照以下步骤校准："

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:123
#: eaac2d8f8225486caa62a79e789c3b64
msgid ""
"On *Mission Planner*'s **INITIAL SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| Battery "
"Monitor** screen set the \"Sensor\" to \"Other\"."
msgstr ""
"在 *Mission Planner* 的 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| Battery "
"Monitor** 界面，将「Sensor」设置为「Other」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:125
#: e248ba9d535a446ab59558342e69a7c4
msgid ""
"Enter the voltage according to the hand-held volt meter in the \"Measured "
"Battery Voltage\" field"
msgstr "在「Measured Battery Voltage」字段输入手持万用表的电压值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:127
#: ffbfdc769f244222bff3532ab4787d32
msgid ""
"Press tab or click out of the field and the \"Voltage Divider (Calced)\" "
"value will update and the \"Battery voltage (Calced)\" should now equal the "
"measured voltage"
msgstr ""
"按 Tab 键或点击字段外部，「Voltage Divider (Calced)」值将更新，「Battery voltage "
"(Calced)」现在应等于测量电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:134
#: 76252cc1b03e4ea8b07b63d9d07bfaed
msgid ""
"Using the power analyser you can also measure the current and compare to "
"results displayed in the Mission Planner. You can also empirically adjust "
"the current scale and offset parameters as explained in :ref:`common-analog-"
"current-calibration`."
msgstr ""
"使用功率分析仪还可以测量电流并与 Mission Planner 中显示的结果对比。您也可以按照 :ref:`common-analog-"
"current-calibration` 中的说明，通过经验调整电流比例和偏移参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:139
#: d474f0365df04085b445d0c0b7a58763
msgid ""
"Most current sensors are not very accurate at low currents (less than 3 "
"Amps). Typically you should perform current calibration at around 10A. The "
"exception is PMs that use hall-effect sensors, like :ref:`those from Mauch "
"<common-mauch-power-modules>`."
msgstr ""
"大多数电流传感器在低电流（小于 3A）时精度不高。通常应在约 10A 时进行电流校准。使用霍尔效应传感器的电源模块（如 :ref:`Mauch "
"的电源模块 <common-mauch-power-modules>`）除外。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:143
#: ccc7c7c255004f158c526a6c7ca4fbff
msgid ""
"This video shows the voltage and current calibration process using a Turnigy"
" Power Analyser."
msgstr "该视频展示了使用 Turnigy 功率分析仪进行电压和电流校准的过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:150
#: 193fb153662444fda0d3853376cb4b08
msgid "Enable Low Battery Alert"
msgstr "启用低电量警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:152
#: 7629a8ae8eda4d0483766887a3536485
msgid ""
"You can set *Mission Planner* to alert you verbally when your battery is low"
" (using a computerized voice)."
msgstr "您可以设置 *Mission Planner* 在电池电量低时通过语音提醒您（使用电脑语音合成）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:155
#: 9a0917e6c1e74b1393f5fdf662d8dc1c
msgid ""
"Simply check the **MP Alert on Low Battery** checkbox and enter the warning "
"you wish to hear, the voltage level and finally the percentage of remaining "
"current."
msgstr "只需勾选 **MP Alert on Low Battery** 复选框，并输入您希望听到的警告内容、电压阈值以及剩余电量百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:170
#: 8c631abe7674416a907002fed4b72b0e
msgid "Connecting power monitor to alternative pins"
msgstr "将电源监控器连接到其他引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:172
#: c0ec28050bef4ab39cfb7ca9009faf08
msgid ""
"The power monitor is generally plugged into the default port on the "
"autopilot (ie. Pixhawk). If you wish to change where the power monitor is "
"plugged into the controller, the pins used can be modified using the "
"``BATT_VOLT_PIN`` and ``BATT_CURR_PIN`` parameters."
msgstr ""
"电源监控器通常插入飞控（如 Pixhawk）的默认接口。如果需要更改电源监控器的连接位置，可以使用 ``BATT_VOLT_PIN`` 和 "
"``BATT_CURR_PIN`` 参数修改所用引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner.rst:177
#: e7ab7f191b5942ebb8cee93dd4dc8ebf
msgid ""
"The list of available analog input pins that can be used are listed on the "
"Hardware Options page for the :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_pixhawk_analog_input_pins>`  board or its board description linked "
"from the :ref:`common-autopilots` page"
msgstr ""
"可用模拟输入引脚的列表在 :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_pixhawk_analog_input_pins>` 板的硬件选项页面，或在 :ref:`common-autopilots` "
"页面链接的板卡描述中列出"
